----- 0.0 -----------------------------------------------------------
04/10/2201	hmichelon
	GUI:	correcting problems with non-visible widgets

----- 0.0-RC -----------------------------------------------------------

28/09/2001	hmichelon
	GUI:	First working version of the new Refresh() scheme

27/08/2001	hmichelon
	All:	Reworking the Makefiles and writting a correct mkdep tool

23/08/2001	hmichelon
	AmigaOS:Implementing ThCriticalSection & ThThread.
			Fixing ConsoleApplication.
	All:	Merging ThCriticalSection*.cpp file with ThThread*.cpp.
			
20/08/2001	hmichelon
	AmigaOS:can be cross-compiled now (68k only).

09/08/2001	hmichelon
	All:	Split libnmo into libnmo & libiface.
	NetBSD:	Now fully supported (using the Pth library).
	OpenBSD:Now fully supported.

08/08/2001	hmichelon
	GUI:	new GScrollBox gadget.
	MacOS:	entire rewrite of the Alarm class by using Carbon events loop timers.
	        Rewrite of the WindowApplication main loop.
	Darwin: Briging port up-to-date with X11 support.
			
06/08/2001	hmichelon
	GUI:	new ShowModal method for GWindow
	All:	new layout for the WindowApplication class

01/08/2001	hmichelon
	GUI:	new GGrid & GGridCell gadgets

23/07/2001	hmichelon
	GUI:	new GWidget::Simulate() method to simulate a user (mouse, keyboard)
			or a system (move, resize, ...) event.
	X11:	Added support for the "Windows" key on XFree86/x86.
			Making event handling multi-threaded
	All:	ThThread::Wait() do nothing when calling on a non-running thread

13/07/2001	hmichelon
	GUI:	resolved GText & GListBox initial refresh (when the window appears) problems.
	All:	removed all useless ListIterator::Reset() call.

10/07/2001	hmichelon
	X11:	opening the screen BEFORE the WindowApplication::OnCreate event
	All:	resolving memory blocks aligments problems on Sparc machines.

09/07/2001	hmichelon
	NetBSD:	now compiling without problems (with GCC 2.95.2), but
	        not linking.
	OpenBSD:now compiling & linking correctly.		

----- PR2.1 -----------------------------------------------------------

06/07/2001	hmichelon
	All:	. Change FileCfg::Load() return type.
			. Corrected DigestMD5 (which never have produced correct MD5 !)
			. DaemonApplicationBSD now exit properly at any moment when 
              calling Application::Terminate()
            . Disabling GTK support in configure. Must use --enable=gtk
			
05/07/2001	hmichelon
	All:	corrected NetIDIP.cpp (removed stupids gethostbyaddr()),
			and improving it with a new value "any" for the hostname.
			(corresponding to INADDR_ANY)

----- PR2 -----------------------------------------------------------

04/07/2001	hmichelon
	All:	new System::Shutdown() method.
	All:	corrected socket closing problems in NetIDIP.cpp
	
11/06/2001	hmichelon
	X11:	using a flag to indicate the main event loop status. Useful
			when calling windows resize/move methods before we enter
			this loop, to emulate the loop calls.

10/06/2001	hmichelon
	Linux:	now compile & run correctly under kernel 2.4 /glibc 2.2.2/XFree86-4
	All:	. corrected IWindow::ResizeDisplay()
			. corrected GScrollBar::OnVScroll()
			. new IWindow::SetBgColor() method
			. two new dectection during configure:: snprintf() & vsnprintf()

10/05/2001	hmichelon
	MacOS:	updated for CarbonLib SDK 1.4

----- PR1 -----------------------------------------------------------

02/05/2001	hmichelon
	All:	preparing the PR1

01/05/2001	hmichelon	
	Unix:	Using thread to start alarms triggered methods in Alarm

29/04/2001	hmichelon
	MacOS:	Implementing a polling system in the SoundDeviceMacOS class
			to avoid reading from disk during interrupt time (== dead locks)
			when filling <big> sound buffers.
			Using ExitToShell() to exit correctly.

22/04/2001	hmichelon
	All:	Rewrite all makefiles and adapt the configure script
			to make the UNIX/GCC build environment more simple
			to maintain.
	Unix:	Merged TimerBSD.cpp and TimerPosix.cpp in one file
			and added tests in the configure script to find
			which functions (BSD/POSIX) to use.

21/04/2001	hmichelon
	All:	Added the SONAME variable to the UNIX/GCC build environment
	Unix:	Makes the /dev/dsp sound driver more portable and renames it
			SoudDriverDsp. Cleanly compile & run under Linux.

20/04/2001	hmichelon
	AtheOS:	Starting port
	All:	Splitted NMO.hpp into NMO.hpp, Base.hpp, Sys.hpp & Datatypes.hpp
	
11/04/2001	hmichelon
	All:	Reviewed the FileCfg class to match the NMO "coding standards". 
						(i.e. every private datas goes abstract)

05/04/2001	hmichelon
	All:	New Done() method in the ThThread class to cleanly
            terminate a thread execution.

04/04/2001	hmichelon
	GUI:	Resolved some recurrent refreshing problems
	        with "transparent" widgets.

03/04/2001	hmichelon
	All:	Added the possibility to pass optionals parameters when
                creating a window (such as the display driver type).

02/04/2001	hmichelon
	All: 	Added a sound driver for the SDL http://www.libsdl.org 
                (minimum support)
	Unix:	First running version of the /dev/dsp sound driver 
                (only for FreeBSD now)
	X11:	Using X11 locking for multithreading

01/04/2001	hmichelon
	Win32:	Updating SoundDeviceDirectSound (was out of date from a long time)

30/03/2001	hmichelon
	All: 	Simplification of the sound package: the SoundDriver* classes 
         	have been removed, everything is in SoundDevice* classes now.

28/03/2001	hmichelon
	Docs: 	new configuration file for Doxygen

18/03/2001	hmichelon
	Common: Corrected the search of named arguments in the Args class

17/03/2001	hmichelon
	Common: Cleaning the Debug.hpp & Debug.cpp files by rewritting
	        some functions.
			Exporting the DebugNewTrace symbol to allow applications
			to activate new/delete operators tracing.
			Cleaning the NMOException class by removing useless methods
			and rewriting the others.

16/03/2001	hmichelon
	Docs: 	Added two mini-docs: macros.txt & debug.txt

